msgstr "Наметни УДП енкапсулацију"

#: editorqml/qml/vpn/l2tp/L2tpIpsec.qml:293
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Some firewalls block ESP traffic. Enforcing UDP encapsulation even if no NAT "
"situation is detected might help in such cases."
